<div id="gt-paso1" class="gt-paso-box" style="display: none; width: 100%; max-width: 750px; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #ffe0b2; border-left: 5px solid #f57c00; border-radius: 6px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
<div style="font-weight: bold; color: #f57c00; margin-bottom: 10px;">Pivote = a<sub>11</sub> <span style="color: #666; font-weight: normal;">| Objetivo: Hacer un 0 en a<sub>21</sub></span></div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 15px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
